# DakuOS kernel – always the newest linux-image from Debian Testing (Forky)
#
# Current Testing metapackage tracks linux 7.0.x (e.g. 7.0.10+deb14-amd64).
# live-build also installs this via --linux-flavours amd64; listing it here
# makes the intent explicit and keeps headers available for out-of-tree modules.

linux-image-amd64
linux-headers-amd64
linux-base

# Firmware helpers often needed with a modern kernel
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
